    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50<strong>Crazy Modes for a Crazy Crew!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.poster.avif?t=1749945849\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.webm?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.mp4?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match features 3 rounds of the weirdest, funniest and most unexpected modes. From shooter parodies to wild runners and brutal PvP battles \u2014 there's something here for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And this is just the beginning\u2026</i><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Party Starts Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.poster.avif?t=1749945849\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.webm?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.mp4?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends or challenge strangers \u2014 play with <strong>2 to 16 players</strong> in every match. The more \u2014 the merrier! Streamers, casual hangouts, online parties \u2014 perfect atmosphere for laughter and pure chaos.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Welcome to the Meme Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters are taken from popular memes. Each has a unique ability that can completely change the flow of the game.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>What's Inside?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 modes per match</strong> \u2014 each round brings a new level of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote for the next mode</strong> \u2014 you decide what to play next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different playstyles</strong>: from chaotic runners to wild PvP.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2014 find out who wins after all rounds are over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Compete. Laugh. Win.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50<strong>Crazy Modes for a Crazy Crew!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.poster.avif?t=1749945849\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.webm?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/0ab700dc49d42580fabafb12e1decfa0.mp4?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match features 3 rounds of the weirdest, funniest and most unexpected modes. From shooter parodies to wild runners and brutal PvP battles \u2014 there's something here for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And this is just the beginning\u2026</i><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Party Starts Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.poster.avif?t=1749945849\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.webm?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476410/extras/68e32812f8a5a6b64305bb29efcb08f9.mp4?t=1749945849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends or challenge strangers \u2014 play with <strong>2 to 16 players</strong> in every match. The more \u2014 the merrier! Streamers, casual hangouts, online parties \u2014 perfect atmosphere for laughter and pure chaos.<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Welcome to the Meme Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters are taken from popular memes. Each has a unique ability that can completely change the flow of the game.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>What's Inside?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 modes per match</strong> \u2014 each round brings a new level of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote for the next mode</strong> \u2014 you decide what to play next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different playstyles</strong>: from chaotic runners to wild PvP.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2014 find out who wins after all rounds are over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Compete. Laugh. Win.</h2>",
    "short_description": "The party starts now! Challenge your friends in wild meme modes where the most unpredictable wins. Play up to 16 players, get a unique character per mode and vote for the next after it ends. This is the ultimate game for non-stop laughs and total chaos!",
